From: PickleHik3 <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 13:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Look for libfeedback in ../lib of the binary

phosh's feedbackd subproject builds libfeedback as a shared library whatever default_library
says, and the archive has it at lib/libfeedback-0.0.so. The archive has bin/phosh-mobile-settings,
so the binary looks one directory up.

diff --git a/src/meson.build b/src/meson.build
index 6f6755e..8978a6f 100644
--- a/src/meson.build
+++ b/src/meson.build
@@ -213,6 +213,9 @@ pms = executable(
   install: true,
   link_with: cc_panels,
   dependencies: [libms_dep, libgcc_dep],
+  # libfeedback (a shared library, built by phosh's feedbackd subproject) is shipped in lib/
+  # next to the directory the binary is installed into
+  install_rpath: '$ORIGIN/../lib',
 )
 
 
